1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,064
这是一台虚拟机上的一个小应用
Here is a small app on one virtual machine:

2
00:00:03,064 --> 00:00:07,125
前面一台 Web 服务器，后面是一个前端和两个 API
a web server in front, a frontend and two APIs behind it.

3
00:00:07,445 --> 00:00:10,453
如果其中一个半夜崩了，谁来重启它？
If one of them crashes in the night, who restarts it?

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,943
凌晨两点，一个 API container 崩了
At two in the morning, one API container crashes.

5
00:00:14,263 --> 00:00:17,327
应用负责人要等用户投诉才知道
The app owner finds out when users complain,

6
00:00:17,327 --> 00:00:21,367
运维通过 SSH 登录进去，手动重启它
and the operator logs in over SSH and restarts it by hand.

7
00:00:21,617 --> 00:00:25,201
在第 20 讲里，Docker 能重启崩掉的 container
In lecture 20, Docker could restart a crashed container,

8
00:00:25,201 --> 00:00:30,961
但只限那一台机器：如果机器本身挂了，整个网站就只能等你来救
but only on that one machine: if the machine itself failed, the whole site waited for you.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,717
于是应用负责人要多台服务器
So the app owner asks for several servers.

10
00:00:34,037 --> 00:00:39,051
运维给了三台机器，每个 API 旁边再放一个备份
The operator answers with three machines, and a backup copy beside each API.

11
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:42,351
每个备份都和它的原件在同一台机器上
Each backup sits on the same machine as its original.

12
00:00:42,671 --> 00:00:48,025
说出一个仍然会让这个 API 挂掉的故障，再说说是谁切换到备份
Name one failure that still takes that API down, and say who switches to the backup.

13
00:00:56,867 --> 00:01:01,646
是机器本身：一块坏掉的磁盘或一次网络故障，会同时带走两份
The machine itself: one failed disk or network takes both copies at once.

14
00:01:01,966 --> 00:01:06,509
而且就算备份活下来了，还是得有人手动切换
And even when a backup survives, a person still has to switch over by hand.

15
00:01:06,750 --> 00:01:09,822
课上要的是，没人醒着也能把三件事做好
The lecture wants three jobs done with nobody awake.

16
00:01:10,142 --> 00:01:12,745
故障转移：一个正常的副本接手
Failover: a working copy takes over.

17
00:01:13,065 --> 00:01:16,094
负载均衡：请求分散到各个副本上
Load balancing: requests spread across copies.

18
00:01:16,414 --> 00:01:18,953
扩展：流量变大时就多开副本
Scaling: more copies when traffic grows.

19
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,522
每当我们看到是谁在做其中一件事
This card comes back each time we see

20
00:01:21,522 --> 00:01:24,597
这张卡片就会回来，那时我们就勾上它
what does one of these jobs, and we tick it then.

21
00:01:24,917 --> 00:01:27,221
三件事用的工具都是 Kubernetes
The tool for all three is Kubernetes.

22
00:01:29,267 --> 00:01:31,238
Kubernetes 是一个编排工具
Kubernetes is an orchestrator:

23
00:01:31,238 --> 00:01:34,325
它在一个由多台机器组成的集群上运行 container
it runs containers across a cluster of machines

24
00:01:34,325 --> 00:01:36,691
并让它们保持你声明的样子
and keeps them the way you declared.

25
00:01:37,011 --> 00:01:39,108
这个名字在希腊语里是舵手的意思
The name is Greek for helmsman,

26
00:01:39,108 --> 00:01:41,747
而第 2 部分用到的工具 Helm，也借了这个词
and Helm, a tool in part 2, borrows it.

27
00:01:41,984 --> 00:01:46,144
左边，一台机器在一个 Docker 引擎上跑所有 container
On the left, one machine runs every container on one Docker engine.

28
00:01:46,464 --> 00:01:48,273
右边，很多台机器，叫作节点
On the right, many machines,

29
00:01:48,273 --> 00:01:53,120
分担这些 container，由一个控制平面来协调
called nodes, share the containers, and one control plane coordinates them.

30
00:01:53,367 --> 00:01:57,451
提醒一句：这里的“部署”指一种部署方式
A word of warning: here, deployment means a way of deploying,

31
00:01:57,451 --> 00:02:00,130
不是我们后面要见到的 Deployment 对象
not the Deployment object we meet later.

32
00:02:00,367 --> 00:02:03,610
在第 20 讲里，奶酪应用跑在一台机器上
In lecture 20 the cheese app ran on one machine.

33
00:02:03,930 --> 00:02:08,111
现在同一个应用搬到集群上，工具里多了 kubectl
Now the same app goes to a cluster, and the tools gain kubectl.

34
00:02:08,431 --> 00:02:10,273
我们的工具箱里已经有它了
Our toolbox already has it,

35
00:02:10,273 --> 00:02:14,639
还有 Helm 和 GKE 认证插件，这两个课件上没列
plus Helm and the GKE auth plugin, which the slides do not list.

36
00:02:14,884 --> 00:02:19,466
跟着做需要：cheese-app-v3，旁边放着你的 secrets 目录
To follow along: cheese-app-v3 with your secrets folder beside it,

37
00:02:19,466 --> 00:02:22,799
再加上 Docker，以及一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目
Docker, and a Google Cloud project with billing.

38
00:02:23,119 --> 00:02:27,449
集群按小时收费，所以每个部分最后都会把它删掉
A cluster costs money by the hour, so each part ends by deleting it.

39
00:02:27,684 --> 00:02:32,299
进度条标出 README 的哪一步，代码面板标出文件和行号
The tracker names the README step, code panels name their file and lines,

40
00:02:32,299 --> 00:02:34,639
your turn 表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and your turn means pause and run it.

41
00:02:34,959 --> 00:02:37,796
角落里的灰色标签标出课件的页码
A grey tag in the corner names the lecture slides.

42
00:02:38,034 --> 00:02:41,853
如实说一句：我们录制用的机器没有 Google 账号
One honest note: our recording machine has no Google account.

43
00:02:42,173 --> 00:02:44,739
在你自己的机器上能跑的都是真的
What runs on a machine you own is real;

44
00:02:44,739 --> 00:02:48,029
每个 Google 步骤都停在它第一个真实的报错处
every Google step stops at its first honest error,

45
00:02:48,029 --> 00:02:49,938
我们会告诉你，你那边会输出什么
and we say what yours prints.

46
00:02:50,184 --> 00:02:53,976
我们跟的是 main，也就是课程网站链接的分支
We follow main, the branch the course site links,

47
00:02:53,976 --> 00:02:56,221
用的是 2025 年 11 月的这个 commit
at this November 2025 commit.

48
00:02:56,541 --> 00:02:59,068
看一下 Git 的提交日志，就知道你手上是哪一个
Git log tells you which one you have.

49
00:02:59,118 --> 00:03:01,512
第 1 部分手动做课上的热身
Part 1 does the lecture's warm-up by hand.

50
00:03:01,832 --> 00:03:04,264
第 2 部分把奶酪应用写成代码来部署
Part 2 deploys the cheese app as code.

51
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,000
我们把集群打开看看
Let's open the cluster.

52
00:03:07,213 --> 00:03:09,368
课上分三步画它
The lecture draws it in three steps.

53
00:03:09,688 --> 00:03:13,823
第一步：一个控制平面，箭头指向几个工作节点
First: one control plane, with arrows to several worker nodes,

54
00:03:13,823 --> 00:03:16,024
每个节点都是一台普通的虚拟机
each an ordinary virtual machine.

55
00:03:16,267 --> 00:03:18,294
第二步，两个平面有了名字
Second, the two planes get names.

56
00:03:18,614 --> 00:03:20,406
控制平面是大脑
The control plane is the brain.

57
00:03:20,726 --> 00:03:24,544
在 GKE 上，它由 Google 运行，你永远看不到它的机器
On GKE, Google runs it, and you never see its machines.

58
00:03:24,864 --> 00:03:26,959
工作节点承载你的 container
The workers carry your containers:

59
00:03:26,959 --> 00:03:29,856
对奶酪应用来说，是一个有一到两个节点的节点池
for the cheese app, a pool of one or two nodes.

60
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:31,565
第三步，各个组件
Third, the parts.

61
00:03:31,615 --> 00:03:36,841
API server 是唯一的入口；其他组件都只和它通信
The API server is the single entry point; every other part talks only to it.

62
00:03:37,161 --> 00:03:41,983
其中 etcd 是集群的记忆：存着集群的状态和配置
Etcd is the memory of the cluster: its state and configuration.

63
00:03:42,217 --> 00:03:44,734
调度器给每个新 Pod 挑一个节点
The scheduler picks a node for each new Pod.

64
00:03:45,054 --> 00:03:46,803
控制器一直在盯着
The controllers keep watching

65
00:03:46,803 --> 00:03:50,662
把你要求的和实际运行的之间的任何差异修正过来
and fix any difference between what you asked for and what runs;

66
00:03:50,662 --> 00:03:53,737
其中一些会向云平台要节点和地址
some of them ask the cloud for nodes and addresses.

67
00:03:53,983 --> 00:03:58,079
每个工作节点上，kubelet 是 API server 的双手
On every worker, the kubelet is the hands of the API server:

68
00:03:58,079 --> 00:04:00,468
它负责启动和停止 container
it starts and stops the containers.

69
00:04:00,788 --> 00:04:03,477
节点上还有 kube-proxy，为 Service 转发流量
kube-proxy routes traffic for Services,

70
00:04:03,477 --> 00:04:06,082
container 运行时负责运行 container
and a container runtime runs the containers,

71
00:04:06,082 --> 00:04:07,682
这些 container 按 Pod 分组
grouped in Pods.

72
00:04:07,850 --> 00:04:11,327
说明一点：课件上写的运行时是 Docker
A small note: the slide names Docker as the runtime.

73
00:04:11,647 --> 00:04:14,023
在 GKE 上是 containerd
On GKE it is containerd,

74
00:04:14,023 --> 00:04:16,895
见 create cluster 那个文件的第 52 行
line 52 of create_cluster.py.

75
00:04:17,215 --> 00:04:20,821
你照样用 Docker 构建 image，它们原样运行
You still build images with Docker, and they run unchanged.

76
00:04:21,067 --> 00:04:22,667
现在顺着箭头走
Now follow the arrows.

77
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:25,793
每条 kubectl 命令都只去一个地方
Every kubectl command goes to one place,

78
00:04:25,793 --> 00:04:29,216
就是 API server，它把你的愿望存进 etcd
the API server, which stores your wish in etcd.

79
00:04:29,536 --> 00:04:32,480
调度器和 kubelet 都从它那里领活
The scheduler and the kubelets pick up their work from it.

80
00:04:32,717 --> 00:04:35,540
课上给 kubectl 定了一套语法
The lecture gives kubectl one grammar:

81
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:39,032
命令、类型、可选的名字，再加参数
a command, a type, an optional name, and flags.

82
00:04:39,352 --> 00:04:40,646
命令 get nodes
Get nodes.

83
00:04:40,696 --> 00:04:44,727
命令 get pods。还有 get pods，加一个参数看所有 namespace
Get pods. Get pods, with a flag for every namespace.

84
00:04:44,967 --> 00:04:48,423
遇到卡住的时候，就问问是哪个组件在等
When something is stuck, ask which of these parts is waiting.

85
00:04:48,743 --> 00:04:51,454
这张图上有四个指示灯，之后会一个个亮起来
Four lamps on this picture will light up later,

86
00:04:51,454 --> 00:04:53,415
每个都对应一个你会碰到的症状
each with a symptom you will meet.

87
00:04:54,550 --> 00:04:58,198
README 把这段热身放在奶酪应用的部署之后
The README keeps this warm-up after the cheese app's deployment.

88
00:04:58,518 --> 00:05:04,491
课上先做它，我们也一样：这是和 kubectl 最温和的第一次接触
The lecture does it first, and so do we: it is the gentlest first contact with kubectl.

89
00:05:04,733 --> 00:05:07,741
首先，在控制台里启用五个 API
First, enable five APIs in the console.

90
00:05:08,061 --> 00:05:11,901
有一个小疏漏：Google Container Registry 已经关停了
A small slip: Google Container Registry has been shut down.

91
00:05:12,221 --> 00:05:14,589
改为启用 Artifact Registry
Enable Artifact Registry instead.

92
00:05:14,833 --> 00:05:19,676
然后启动工具箱：在 src 目录里，进到 deployment
Then start the toolbox: from the src folder, change into deployment and run docker-shell.sh.

93
00:05:19,676 --> 00:05:21,980
运行 docker-shell.sh
Then start the toolbox: from the src folder, change into deployment and run docker-shell.sh.

94
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:24,024
按提交的原样，它会失败
As committed, it fails:

95
00:05:24,024 --> 00:05:27,847
先是 Debian 的 404 Not Found，然后是 pull access denied
404 Not Found from Debian, then pull access denied.

96
00:05:28,083 --> 00:05:30,869
如果你做过第 20 讲，就见过这个
If you did lecture 20, you have seen this:

97
00:05:30,869 --> 00:05:35,379
基础 image 是 Debian bullseye，它的安全更新包已经没了
the base image is Debian bullseye, whose security packages are gone.

98
00:05:35,699 --> 00:05:38,686
Windows 上没有 docker-shell.bat
On Windows there is no docker-shell.bat.

99
00:05:39,006 --> 00:05:40,583
用 WSL
Use WSL.

100
00:05:40,633 --> 00:05:44,238
修复还是那两处一行的修改，在这里是额外步骤
The fix is the same two one-line edits, an extra here.

101
00:05:44,558 --> 00:05:46,588
把 bullseye 换成 bookworm
Bullseye becomes bookworm,

102
00:05:46,588 --> 00:05:50,180
把 google-cloud-sdk 换成 google-cloud-cli
and google-cloud-sdk becomes google-cloud-cli,

103
00:05:50,180 --> 00:05:52,132
再加上它的 GKE 认证插件
with its GKE auth plugin.

104
00:05:52,452 --> 00:05:56,143
每次 kubectl 调用 GKE 都要经过这个插件
Every kubectl call to GKE goes through that plugin.

105
00:05:56,383 --> 00:05:57,849
和第 20 讲一样
As in lecture 20,

106
00:05:57,849 --> 00:06:02,335
也把你的项目填到 docker-shell.sh 的第 13 行
also put your project on line 13 of docker-shell.sh.

107
00:06:02,583 --> 00:06:06,423
再跑一次：大约 92 秒构建完，然后启动
Run it again: it builds in about 92 seconds and starts.

108
00:06:06,743 --> 00:06:10,823
接着登录失败，因为我们的密钥不属于任何账号
The login then fails, because our key belongs to no account;

109
00:06:10,823 --> 00:06:14,359
换成你的，这几行会显示 activated 和 logged in
with yours, these lines say activated and logged in.

110
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,679
在这里暂停一下，启动你的工具箱
Pause here and start your toolbox;

111
00:06:16,679 --> 00:06:19,187
这一部分剩下的步骤都在它的提示符下运行
the rest of this part runs at its prompt.

112
00:06:19,433 --> 00:06:21,033
接下来，检查工具
Next, check the tools.

113
00:06:21,246 --> 00:06:24,148
工具 gcloud 和它的认证插件都在
The gcloud tool and its auth plugin are there.

114
00:06:24,468 --> 00:06:27,143
只敲 kubectl version，会先打印客户端版本
Plain kubectl version prints the client,

115
00:06:27,143 --> 00:06:29,150
然后是 connection refused
then connection refused: there

116
00:06:29,150 --> 00:06:32,895
还没有集群，所以服务端那一半没有人可问
is no cluster yet, so the server half has nobody to ask.

117
00:06:33,883 --> 00:06:38,059
有个小意外：Dockerfile pin 了一个 kubectl 版本
A small surprise: the Dockerfile pins one kubectl version,

118
00:06:38,059 --> 00:06:43,099
但 Google 自己的包胜出了：一个按集群匹配版本的 dispatcher
but Google's own package wins: a dispatcher that matches each cluster.

119
00:06:43,333 --> 00:06:47,152
最后，检查你是否已经认证：gcloud auth list
Last, check that you are authenticated: gcloud auth list.

120
00:06:47,472 --> 00:06:49,737
我们的显示 No credentialed accounts
Ours says No credentialed accounts;

121
00:06:49,737 --> 00:06:53,168
你的会把 deployment 服务账号列为 active
yours lists the deployment service account as active.

122
00:06:54,417 --> 00:06:58,351
现在做 Create Cluster 这一步：gcloud container clusters
Now Create Cluster: gcloud container clusters create

123
00:06:58,351 --> 00:07:01,756
create test-cluster --num-nodes 2 --zone us-east1-c
test-cluster --num-nodes 2 --zone us-east1-c.

124
00:07:02,076 --> 00:07:04,892
我们的马上就停了：no active account
Ours stops at once: no active account.

125
00:07:05,212 --> 00:07:09,073
暂停一下，跑你的；它存在的每个小时都在花钱
Pause and run yours; it costs money every hour it exists.

126
00:07:09,717 --> 00:07:11,453
你的要等一会儿
Yours takes a short wait,

127
00:07:11,453 --> 00:07:15,063
打印一张表，并在你的 kubeconfig 里加一条记录
prints a table, and adds an entry to your kubeconfig

128
00:07:15,063 --> 00:07:17,077
让 kubectl 知道该连哪里
so kubectl knows where to go.

129
00:07:17,397 --> 00:07:19,015
课件上只建一个节点
The slide makes one node;

130
00:07:19,015 --> 00:07:22,965
README 建两个，这样两个副本可以落在不同的机器上
the README two, so two copies can land on different machines.

131
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:26,106
为了继续往下做，我们起一个小小的真集群
To keep going, we start a small real cluster

132
00:07:26,106 --> 00:07:30,731
在笔记本上用一个叫 kind 的工具：一个控制平面，两个工作节点
on the laptop with a tool called kind: one control plane, two workers.

133
00:07:31,051 --> 00:07:33,822
一样的 API server，一样的 kubectl
Same API server, same kubectl, same YAML,

134
00:07:33,822 --> 00:07:35,445
一样的 YAML，只是没有 Google
but no Google.

135
00:07:35,765 --> 00:07:38,176
它不在 README 里；你别跑
It is not in the README; don't run it.

136
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:42,606
在这里，连控制平面都是一个我们看得见的 container
Here even the control plane is a container we can see;

137
00:07:42,606 --> 00:07:44,340
在 GKE 上，Google 把它藏起来了
on GKE, Google hides it.

138
00:07:44,584 --> 00:07:46,646
接下来，在控制台里看一圈
Next, look around the console:

139
00:07:46,646 --> 00:07:49,601
Kubernetes Engine、你的集群、它的节点
Kubernetes Engine, your cluster, its nodes,

140
00:07:49,601 --> 00:07:51,389
还有每个节点上的 Pod
and the Pods on each node.

141
00:07:51,709 --> 00:07:55,613
在 Compute Engine 里，你的节点就是普通的虚拟机
In Compute Engine, your nodes are ordinary virtual machines.

142
00:07:56,350 --> 00:07:58,505
然后试几条 kubectl 命令
Then try some kubectl commands.

143
00:07:58,825 --> 00:08:00,999
先来一个额外的，kubectl version
First an extra, kubectl version:

144
00:08:00,999 --> 00:08:05,417
dispatcher 挑了一个和服务端版本匹配的客户端
the dispatcher picked a client that matches the server's version.

145
00:08:05,967 --> 00:08:07,788
README 的第一条命令 get all
The first README command,

146
00:08:07,788 --> 00:08:11,212
只显示一个叫 kubernetes 的 Service
get all, shows only a service named kubernetes,

147
00:08:11,212 --> 00:08:13,690
它就是通往 API server 本身的门
the door to the API server itself.

148
00:08:14,010 --> 00:08:17,636
我们看的是叫 default 的 namespace；这个后面再说
We are looking in the namespace called default; more on that later.

149
00:08:18,184 --> 00:08:21,113
加上所有 namespace，kube-system 就出现了
With all namespaces, kube-system appears,

150
00:08:21,113 --> 00:08:24,542
在这里能按名字认出控制平面
and here you can spot the control plane by name:

151
00:08:24,542 --> 00:08:28,829
etcd、API server、controller manager 和调度器
etcd, the API server, the controller manager, the scheduler.

152
00:08:29,149 --> 00:08:31,026
在 GKE 上这些都是隐藏的
On GKE those stay hidden.

153
00:08:31,267 --> 00:08:34,385
命令 get componentstatuses 会打印一条弃用警告
componentstatuses prints a deprecation warning,

154
00:08:34,385 --> 00:08:37,304
这是预期的，然后是三行 healthy
which is expected, then three healthy lines.

155
00:08:37,624 --> 00:08:41,103
用 get nodes 检查更好：这里三个节点都是 Ready
Get nodes is the better check: three nodes ready here;

156
00:08:41,103 --> 00:08:44,003
你的会显示两个工作节点，没有控制平面
yours shows two workers and no control plane.

157
00:08:44,323 --> 00:08:45,966
暂停一下，五条都试一试
Pause and try all five.

158
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:50,259
热身部署一个小游戏，tic-tac-toe
The warm-up deploys a small game, tic-tac-toe,

159
00:08:50,259 --> 00:08:52,320
用的是一个文件里的两个对象
from one file with two objects.

160
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:55,013
Deployment 说明 Pod 里跑什么
The Deployment says what runs in a Pod,

161
00:08:55,013 --> 00:08:57,568
跑几个副本，并保持它们一直运行
how many copies, and to keep them running.

162
00:08:57,888 --> 00:09:01,536
Service 说明流量怎么到达它们，Pod 死了也没关系
The Service says how traffic reaches them, and lets Pods die.

163
00:09:01,783 --> 00:09:04,556
课件省略了把它们粘在一起的那几行
The slide trims the lines that glue them together.

164
00:09:04,876 --> 00:09:08,089
模板给每个 Pod 打上一个 label，run: web
The template gives every Pod a label, run: web;

165
00:09:08,089 --> 00:09:11,917
两个对象都按这个 label 找到自己的 Pod，而不是按名字
both objects find their Pods by that label, not by name.

166
00:09:12,467 --> 00:09:15,803
每个 Pod 运行 dlops/tic-tac-toe 这个 image
Each Pod runs the image dlops/tic-tac-toe,

167
00:09:15,803 --> 00:09:17,630
监听 port 8080
listening on port 8080.

168
00:09:17,950 --> 00:09:21,789
Service 监听 port 80，转发到 8080
The Service listens on port 80 and forwards to 8080.

169
00:09:23,033 --> 00:09:26,852
部署应用：kubectl apply -f，加上这个文件
Deploy the app: kubectl apply -f, and the file.

170
00:09:27,172 --> 00:09:29,828
命令 apply 只是把一个愿望交给 API server
Apply only hands a wish to the API server;

171
00:09:29,828 --> 00:09:34,319
调度器挑两个节点，它们的 kubelet 启动 container
the scheduler picks two nodes, and their kubelets start the containers.

172
00:09:34,867 --> 00:09:38,179
一个额外检查，rollout status，看着它发生
An extra check, rollout status, watches it happen:

173
00:09:38,179 --> 00:09:40,298
先是 0，然后 2 个里 1 个可用
zero, then one of two available,

174
00:09:40,298 --> 00:09:43,080
最后 rolled out，分别在两个不同的工作节点上
then rolled out, on two different workers.

175
00:09:44,817 --> 00:09:47,164
接下来，kubectl get services
Next, kubectl get services.

176
00:09:47,484 --> 00:09:50,951
名叫 web 的 Service 是一个负载均衡器
The web Service is a load balancer:

177
00:09:50,951 --> 00:09:57,489
port 80，映射到每个节点上的 31366，再到 Pod 里的 8080
port 80, mapped to 31366 on every node, and on to 8080 in the Pod.

178
00:09:57,809 --> 00:09:59,921
它的外部 IP 显示 pending
Its external IP says pending.

179
00:10:00,467 --> 00:10:03,027
43 秒以后还是 pending
43 seconds later it still says pending.

180
00:10:03,347 --> 00:10:06,504
集群图上是哪个组件在等，在等什么？
Which part of the cluster picture is waiting, and on what?

181
00:10:15,350 --> 00:10:18,209
是控制器，在等云平台
The controllers, waiting on the cloud provider.

182
00:10:18,529 --> 00:10:23,477
在 GKE 上，它们向 Google 要一个负载均衡器和一个地址
On GKE they ask Google for a load balancer and an address, which arrives

183
00:10:23,477 --> 00:10:25,071
等一会儿就来了
after a short wait.

184
00:10:25,121 --> 00:10:27,681
这个 kind 集群没有云平台可问
The kind cluster has no cloud to ask.

185
00:10:28,417 --> 00:10:31,307
暂停一下：在 GKE 上，等外部 IP 出来
Pause: on GKE, wait for the external IP,

186
00:10:31,307 --> 00:10:34,774
把它复制到浏览器里，游戏就出现了
copy it into your browser, and the game appears.

187
00:10:36,017 --> 00:10:37,916
在替身上，一个额外步骤
On the stand-in, an extra:

188
00:10:37,916 --> 00:10:41,350
对这个 Service 做 port-forward，再 curl：200 OK
port-forward to the Service, then curl: 200 OK.

189
00:10:41,670 --> 00:10:44,239
课上建议在你的浏览器里打开
The lecture suggests it for your browser,

190
00:10:44,239 --> 00:10:47,689
但在工具箱里，这个 port 是在 container 里面打开的
but from the toolbox the port opens inside the container:

191
00:10:47,689 --> 00:10:49,289
就在那里测
test it there.

192
00:10:49,933 --> 00:10:53,453
回到半夜那个问题：谁来重启 container？
Back to the night-time problem: who restarts the container?

193
00:10:53,773 --> 00:10:56,034
在 Kubernetes 里，是控制器
In Kubernetes, a controller does.

194
00:10:56,354 --> 00:10:57,954
我们来看一个控制器干活
Let's watch one work.

195
00:10:58,233 --> 00:11:00,281
一个额外的列表把这条链显示出来
An extra listing shows the chain.

196
00:11:00,601 --> 00:11:03,407
名叫 web 的 Deployment 拥有一个 ReplicaSet
The Deployment named web owns a ReplicaSet,

197
00:11:03,407 --> 00:11:06,212
它的名字加上了 Pod 模板的哈希值
whose name adds a hash of the Pod template.

198
00:11:06,532 --> 00:11:08,479
这个 ReplicaSet 拥有两个 Pod
The ReplicaSet owns two Pods,

199
00:11:08,479 --> 00:11:11,566
每个都带着这个哈希值和一个随机的短后缀
each with that hash and a short random suffix.

200
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:13,499
看 label 就能确认
The labels confirm it:

201
00:11:13,499 --> 00:11:17,220
每个 Pod 都带着模板哈希和 run: web 这个 label
every Pod carries the template hash and the run: web label.

202
00:11:17,466 --> 00:11:19,821
ReplicaSet 控制器跑一个循环
The ReplicaSet controller runs a loop:

203
00:11:19,821 --> 00:11:24,655
观察 Pod，和你声明的数量比较，针对差异采取行动
observe the Pods, compare with the number you declared, act on the difference.

204
00:11:24,975 --> 00:11:28,922
数量由你设；控制器让它一直成立，就像恒温器
You set the number; the controller keeps it true, like a thermostat.

205
00:11:29,466 --> 00:11:33,413
先再来一个额外的：kubectl scale，replicas 设成 4
First, one more extra: kubectl scale --replicas=4.

206
00:11:33,733 --> 00:11:36,558
又出现两个 Pod，分布在两个工作节点上
Two more Pods appear, spread over both workers,

207
00:11:36,558 --> 00:11:38,661
Service 已经把它们列进去了
and the Service already lists them.

208
00:11:38,981 --> 00:11:44,485
缩回 2 个，记住这条命令：你们项目的 Milestone 5 会要求它
Scale back to 2, and remember this command: your project's Milestone 5 asks for it.

209
00:11:45,050 --> 00:11:47,247
现在删掉两个 web Pod 中的一个
Now delete one of the two web Pods.

210
00:11:47,567 --> 00:11:52,623
一秒钟后，有几个 web Pod，新名字里哪一部分保持不变？
A second later, how many web Pods are there, and which part of the new name stays the same?

211
00:12:01,466 --> 00:12:06,245
两个。命令 delete 一返回，新 Pod 就已经在创建了
Two. The delete returns, and a new Pod is already being created.

212
00:12:06,565 --> 00:12:10,042
它的名字保留了 ReplicaSet 的哈希值，后缀是新的
Its name keeps the ReplicaSet hash, with a new suffix.

213
00:12:10,283 --> 00:12:12,480
15 秒后，两个都在运行
15 seconds later, both run.

214
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:15,872
没有人登录：循环发现了差异，就动手了
Nobody logged in: the loop noticed, and acted.

215
00:12:16,116 --> 00:12:21,364
这就勾上了故障转移，再加一个如实的补充：这是重启，不是热备
That ticks failover, with an honest footnote: it is a restart, not a hot standby.

216
00:12:21,684 --> 00:12:27,487
只有一个副本时会有一段短暂的空档，所以游戏的文件要求两个副本
With one replica there is a short gap, which is why the game's file asks for two replicas.

217
00:12:28,033 --> 00:12:32,193
在第 20 讲里，Docker 在同一台机器上重启 container
In lecture 20, Docker restarted a container on the same machine.

218
00:12:32,513 --> 00:12:35,990
ReplicaSet 会把新 Pod 放到任何有空间的地方
A ReplicaSet places a new Pod wherever there is room.

219
00:12:36,310 --> 00:12:38,700
声明结果，别去写步骤的脚本
Declare the result, don't script the steps.

220
00:12:39,950 --> 00:12:42,745
Pod 是会死的：新 Pod 拿到了一个新地址
Pods are mortal: the new Pod got a new address.

221
00:12:43,065 --> 00:12:44,814
那流量怎么找到它？
So how does traffic find it?

222
00:12:45,134 --> 00:12:46,729
Service 维护一张列表
The Service keeps a list of every Pod wearing its label, and that list follows the Pods.

223
00:12:46,729 --> 00:12:50,339
记着每个贴着它 label 的 Pod，这张列表跟着 Pod 变
The Service keeps a list of every Pod wearing its label, and that list follows the Pods.

224
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:55,065
从一个用完即弃的 Pod 里做个额外检查
An extra from a throwaway Pod:

225
00:12:55,065 --> 00:13:00,078
web.default.svc.cluster.local 这个名字指向这个 Service
the name web.default.svc.cluster.local points to the Service,

226
00:13:00,078 --> 00:13:03,693
只取 web 就能拿到游戏页面
and fetching just web returns the game page.

227
00:13:04,013 --> 00:13:06,040
Pod 在变，名字不变
The name stays while the Pods change.

228
00:13:06,283 --> 00:13:10,320
奶酪应用的 API 之后也会这样找到它的数据库
This is how the cheese app's API will find its database:

229
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:12,555
按 Service 名字，vector-db
by the Service name, vector-db.

230
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:16,704
再一个额外的：kubectl exec 进到 web 这个 Deployment
Another extra: kubectl exec into the web Deployment.

231
00:13:17,024 --> 00:13:19,940
命令 hostname 打印出其中一个 Pod 的名字
Hostname prints the name of one Pod, and the game's files are inside.

232
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:21,540
游戏的文件就在里面
Hostname prints the name of one Pod, and the game's files are inside.

233
00:13:21,632 --> 00:13:24,619
README 也是这样进到 API 的 shell 里
The README shells into the API the same way.

234
00:13:24,867 --> 00:13:26,659
为什么 get all 看起来是空的？
Why did get all look empty?

235
00:13:26,979 --> 00:13:29,560
因为 namespace：装对象的目录
Namespaces: folders for objects.

236
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:33,090
不加参数时，kubectl 只看 default
Without a flag, kubectl looks only in default;

237
00:13:33,090 --> 00:13:34,626
这个额外步骤先把它们列出来
this extra lists them,

238
00:13:34,626 --> 00:13:38,115
再创建并删除 cheese-app-namespace
then creates and deletes the cheese-app-namespace.

239
00:13:38,733 --> 00:13:41,711
所以在第 2 部分，每条和应用有关的命令都要
So in part 2, every command about the app

240
00:13:41,711 --> 00:13:45,197
在参数的位置加上 -n cheese-app-namespace
gets -n cheese-app-namespace, in the flags slot.

241
00:13:45,833 --> 00:13:51,124
删除集群之前，一个额外提示：用同一个文件做 kubectl delete
Before deleting the cluster, an extra tip: kubectl delete with the same file.

242
00:13:51,444 --> 00:13:56,372
在 GKE 上，这样能在集群还在的时候把负载均衡器释放掉
On GKE, this releases the load balancer while the cluster still exists.

243
00:13:56,617 --> 00:13:58,923
然后删除集群：gcloud container clusters
Then delete the cluster:

244
00:13:58,923 --> 00:14:03,465
delete test-cluster --zone us-east1-c
gcloud container clusters delete test-cluster --zone us-east1-c.

245
00:14:03,785 --> 00:14:06,601
你的会问要不要继续；回答 yes
Yours asks whether to continue; answer yes.

246
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:08,750
替身我们也删掉
We delete the stand-in too.

247
00:14:10,650 --> 00:14:14,170
课上最后一句话用在这里正合适：别忘了删除
The lecture's last word fits here: don't forget to delete.

248
00:14:14,490 --> 00:14:18,351
暂停一下，确认你的测试集群已经没了，第 1 部分就完成了
Pause, check that your test cluster is gone, and part 1 is done.

249
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:23,035
第 2 部分：把奶酪应用作为 Pulumi 代码部署到 GKE 上
Part 2: the cheese app on GKE, as Pulumi code.

250
00:14:23,355 --> 00:14:24,855
课程链接落在这一节
The course link lands

251
00:14:24,855 --> 00:14:27,683
Deployment with Scaling using Kubernetes
on Deployment with Scaling using Kubernetes;

252
00:14:27,683 --> 00:14:32,677
集群的步骤，接在下一个小节 Create & Deploy Cluster 里
the cluster steps continue under the next heading, Create & Deploy Cluster.

253
00:14:33,417 --> 00:14:36,724
这是整个计划，一块一块地从第 20 讲对过来
Here is the plan, piece by piece from lecture 20.

254
00:14:37,044 --> 00:14:39,902
每个长期运行的 container 变成一个 Deployment
Each long-running container becomes a Deployment.

255
00:14:40,222 --> 00:14:42,513
一次性的加载器变成一个 Job
The one-shot loader becomes a Job:

256
00:14:42,513 --> 00:14:47,433
运行失败会重试几次，一旦成功，就保持完成状态
it retries a failed run a few times, and once it succeeds, it stays done.

257
00:14:47,967 --> 00:14:52,639
Docker 网络上的 container 名字变成带 DNS 名字的 Service
Container names on a Docker network become Services with DNS names.

258
00:14:52,959 --> 00:14:59,103
VM 磁盘上的目录变成两个 PVC，每个背后是一块云磁盘
The folders on the VM disk become two persistent volume claims, each backed by a cloud disk.

259
00:14:59,350 --> 00:15:02,576
那个 nginx container 变成一个 Ingress controller
The nginx container becomes an Ingress controller

260
00:15:02,576 --> 00:15:04,176
加上一条 Ingress 规则
with an Ingress rule.

261
00:15:04,278 --> 00:15:08,758
JSON 密钥变成 Workload Identity，完全没有密钥文件
The JSON key becomes Workload Identity, with no key file at all.

262
00:15:09,078 --> 00:15:11,979
一台机器变成一个有一到两个节点的节点池
One machine becomes a pool of one or two nodes.

263
00:15:12,217 --> 00:15:14,137
外面围着一个私有网络
Around it, a private network.

264
00:15:14,457 --> 00:15:16,745
节点没有公网地址
The nodes get no public addresses;

265
00:15:16,745 --> 00:15:19,436
一个 Cloud NAT 网关让它们能往外连
a Cloud NAT gateway lets them reach out,

266
00:15:19,436 --> 00:15:22,329
比如从 Docker Hub 拉取 Chroma
for example to pull Chroma from Docker Hub.

267
00:15:22,649 --> 00:15:26,446
应用放在一个 namespace 里，前面是一个负载均衡器
The app sits in one namespace, behind one load balancer.

268
00:15:28,050 --> 00:15:31,722
在 deploy k8s 里，程序用四次调用说了同样的事
The program in deploy_k8s says the same in four calls,

269
00:15:31,722 --> 00:15:36,754
一个文件一次：网络、集群、container、负载均衡器
one per file: the network, the cluster, the containers, the load balancer.

270
00:15:37,074 --> 00:15:41,063
第 17 行让 HTTPS 版本保持关闭
Line 17 keeps the HTTPS variant switched off.

271
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:45,872
它运行期间一直在花钱：区域集群的管理费
While it is up, it costs money: the fee of a regional cluster,

272
00:15:45,872 --> 00:15:50,141
一到两个节点、一个负载均衡器、一个 NAT 网关和两块磁盘
one or two nodes, a load balancer, one NAT gateway and two disks.

273
00:15:50,461 --> 00:15:53,772
按我们的估算，大约每天 5 到 8 美元
By our estimate, roughly five to eight dollars a day:

274
00:15:53,772 --> 00:15:57,395
去查一下价格计算器，当天就 destroy 掉
check the pricing calculator, and destroy it the same day.

275
00:15:59,733 --> 00:16:03,186
这一节再次启用那五个 API
This section enables the five APIs again;

276
00:16:03,186 --> 00:16:07,818
把 Vertex AI API 也打开，API 的 Pod 要调用它
turn on the Vertex AI API too, which the API Pods call.

277
00:16:08,566 --> 00:16:11,915
你还需要第 20 讲的两个服务账号
You also need the two service accounts from lecture 20.

278
00:16:12,235 --> 00:16:15,222
其中 deployment 账号做工具箱要做的事
The deployment account does what the toolbox does,

279
00:16:15,222 --> 00:16:17,611
在这里它还是节点的身份
and here it is also the nodes' identity.

280
00:16:17,931 --> 00:16:22,796
而 gcp-service 账号是给 API 的 Pod 用的，不需要密钥文件
The gcp-service account is for the API Pods, with no key file.

281
00:16:23,533 --> 00:16:26,008
README 漏掉了两个一次性的步骤
Two one-time steps the README leaves out.

282
00:16:26,328 --> 00:16:28,671
deployment 账号很可能需要一个角色
The deployment account very likely

283
00:16:28,671 --> 00:16:31,634
gcp-service 上的 Service Account Admin
needs Service Account Admin on gcp-service;

284
00:16:31,634 --> 00:16:33,234
这一点我们没法测试
we could not test this.

285
00:16:33,538 --> 00:16:37,591
还要创建 registry 仓库 cheese-app-repository
And create the registry repository, cheese-app-repository,

286
00:16:37,591 --> 00:16:39,191
没有任何代码会创建它
which no code creates.

287
00:16:39,866 --> 00:16:43,118
把 deployment 的密钥放进 secrets 目录
The deployment key goes in the secrets folder,

288
00:16:43,118 --> 00:16:45,946
和 repo 并排，和第 20 讲一样
beside the repository, as in lecture 20.

289
00:16:46,683 --> 00:16:50,159
然后是第 1 部分的工具箱步骤，命令一样
Then the toolbox steps from part 1, the same commands;

290
00:16:50,159 --> 00:16:54,406
如果工具箱还在运行，脚本会直接接入它
if the toolbox is still running, the script simply attaches to it.

291
00:16:54,650 --> 00:16:59,322
接下来是 images stack，只在你之前没构建过时才做
Next, the images stack, only if you have not built it before:

292
00:16:59,322 --> 00:17:01,313
进到 deploy images
change into deploy_images,

293
00:17:01,313 --> 00:17:05,295
运行 pulumi stack init dev，再把 gcp:project 设成你的
pulumi stack init dev, and set gcp:project to yours.

294
00:17:05,615 --> 00:17:08,575
我们的显示 Pulumi access token must be set
Ours says PULUMI_ACCESS_TOKEN must be set:

295
00:17:08,575 --> 00:17:13,295
我们的 bucket 登录失败了，所以 Pulumi 退回到它自己的云服务
our bucket login failed, so Pulumi falls back to its cloud service.

296
00:17:13,533 --> 00:17:16,924
为了展示剩下的部分，我们让 Pulumi 指向一个本地目录
To show the rest, we point Pulumi at a local folder,

297
00:17:16,924 --> 00:17:19,336
这是录制用的权宜之计：你别跑
a recording workaround: don't run it.

298
00:17:19,656 --> 00:17:22,152
现在 stack 创建好了，和你的一样
Now the stack is created, as yours is.

299
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:25,509
然后是 pulumi preview --stack dev：三个 image 构建
Then pulumi preview --stack dev: three image builds,

300
00:17:25,509 --> 00:17:29,035
在 preview 里会跳过，还有三个打上时间戳的 tag
skipped in a preview, and three tags stamped with the time.

301
00:17:29,355 --> 00:17:32,768
要创建 4 个：三个 image，加上 stack 本身
+ 4 to create: three images and the stack itself.

302
00:17:33,016 --> 00:17:34,673
这些 tag 输出很重要
Those tag outputs matter:

303
00:17:34,673 --> 00:17:38,052
deploy k8s 通过 stack reference 查到它们
deploy_k8s looks them up through a stack reference,

304
00:17:38,052 --> 00:17:39,907
才知道要运行哪些 image
to know which images to run.

305
00:17:40,150 --> 00:17:45,206
最后，pulumi up --stack dev -y：它构建并 push 三个 image
Last, pulumi up --stack dev -y: it builds and pushes three images.

306
00:17:45,526 --> 00:17:47,998
可以跳过，如果你在第 20 讲做过
Skip it if you did it in lecture 20,

307
00:17:47,998 --> 00:17:50,196
但有一个条件，我们接下来会讲
with one condition we meet next;

308
00:17:50,196 --> 00:17:52,118
否则就暂停一下，跑一遍
otherwise, pause and run it.

309
00:17:53,367 --> 00:17:55,330
现在是 Create & Deploy Cluster
Now Create & Deploy Cluster.

310
00:17:55,650 --> 00:17:59,188
在 deployment 目录里，进到 deploy k8s
From the deployment folder, change into deploy_k8s

311
00:17:59,188 --> 00:18:01,311
运行 pulumi stack init dev
and run pulumi stack init dev:

312
00:18:01,311 --> 00:18:06,124
同样的令牌报错，在本地 backend 上则是 Created stack dev
the same token error, and on the local backend, Created stack 'dev'.

313
00:18:06,767 --> 00:18:11,827
然后是三个 config 键：你的项目，以及两个服务账号的邮箱
Then three config keys: your project, and two service account emails,

314
00:18:11,827 --> 00:18:13,807
deployment 和 gcp-service
deployment and gcp-service.

315
00:18:14,127 --> 00:18:17,882
三处都把 ac215-project 换成你的
Replace ac215-project with yours in all three.

316
00:18:19,384 --> 00:18:23,779
第 9 行填 deployment 的邮箱：节点以这个账号运行
Line 9 takes the deployment email: the nodes run as that account.

317
00:18:24,099 --> 00:18:29,709
第 10 行填 gcp-service 的邮箱，API 的 Pod 会扮演这个账号
Line 10 takes the gcp-service email, which the API Pods will act as.

318
00:18:29,950 --> 00:18:33,388
一个额外命令 pulumi config，列出你的三个键
An extra, pulumi config, lists your three keys

319
00:18:33,388 --> 00:18:36,527
还有提交的文件里留下的两个
and two leftovers from the committed file,

320
00:18:36,527 --> 00:18:40,638
setupSSL 和一个 SSH 用户，程序从来没用过
setupSSL and an SSH user, which the program never uses.

321
00:18:40,958 --> 00:18:44,777
键名打错一个字，后面会悄悄失败，所以检查一下这张列表
A typo in a key name fails quietly later, so check this list.

322
00:18:45,017 --> 00:18:46,517
然后是 Preview 这一步
Then Preview:

323
00:18:46,517 --> 00:18:48,656
pulumi preview --stack dev --refresh
pulumi preview --stack dev --refresh.

324
00:18:48,706 --> 00:18:50,075
在本地 backend 上
On the local backend,

325
00:18:50,075 --> 00:18:53,269
setup containers 第 70 行报一个 Python 错误
a Python error at line 70 of setup_containers.py:

326
00:18:53,269 --> 00:18:55,812
NoneType object is not subscriptable
'NoneType' object is not subscriptable.

327
00:18:56,132 --> 00:19:00,078
程序向 images stack 要它的 tag，什么都没拿到
The program asked the images stack for its tags, and got nothing.

328
00:19:00,317 --> 00:19:03,085
你会看到这个，如果 images stack 从来没有
You see this if the images stack never finished

329
00:19:03,085 --> 00:19:05,330
在同一个 state bucket 里跑完 pulumi up
pulumi up in this same state bucket.

330
00:19:05,650 --> 00:19:08,509
只有它已经在那里跑过，跳过才安全
Skipping it is safe only when it already ran there.

331
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:13,114
所以我们给程序一个带占位 tag 的替身 images stack
So we gave the program a stand-in images stack with placeholder tags;

332
00:19:13,114 --> 00:19:14,460
什么都没构建
nothing is built.

333
00:19:14,510 --> 00:19:16,446
现在真正的计划出现了
Now the real plan appears:

334
00:19:16,446 --> 00:19:22,702
网络、集群、节点池、Kubernetes 对象，一共要创建 23 个
the network, the cluster, the node pool, the Kubernetes objects, and + 23 to create.

335
00:19:22,950 --> 00:19:26,451
还有两行是查询，不算在 23 个里
Two more lines are lookups, not counted in the 23:

336
00:19:26,451 --> 00:19:29,393
stack reference 和 nginx 的 Service
the stack reference and the nginx Service.

337
00:19:29,713 --> 00:19:32,890
在输出里，只有集群名字是已知的
In the outputs, only the cluster name is known;

338
00:19:32,890 --> 00:19:36,540
地址和 URL 要等集群建好才有
the address and the URL wait until the cluster exists.

339
00:19:36,784 --> 00:19:38,663
暂停一下，跑你的 preview
Pause and run your preview:

340
00:19:38,663 --> 00:19:42,074
你应该看到同样的 23 个，只是带着真实的 image tag
you should see the same 23, with real image tags.

341
00:19:43,217 --> 00:19:47,100
然后是重头戏：pulumi up --stack dev --refresh -y
Then the big one: pulumi up --stack dev --refresh -y.

342
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:52,095
在本地 backend 上，更新开始了，第一个资源，也就是网络
On the local backend the update starts, and the very first resource, the network,

343
00:19:52,095 --> 00:19:55,270
就失败了：Invalid grant: account not found
fails: invalid_grant: Invalid grant: account not found.

344
00:19:55,517 --> 00:20:00,104
网络是第一个需要 Google 的东西，所以从这里开始是示意图
The network is the first thing that needs Google, so from here on this is a picture.

345
00:20:00,424 --> 00:20:03,624
暂停一下，启动你的；从现在起，计费表就开始走了
Pause and start yours; from now on, the meter runs.

346
00:20:05,867 --> 00:20:08,000
Pulumi 按依赖关系来
Pulumi follows the dependencies.

347
00:20:08,320 --> 00:20:10,262
先是网络和它的子网
First the network and its subnet.

348
00:20:10,582 --> 00:20:15,009
然后并排进行：带 NAT 网关的路由器，以及集群
Then, side by side, the router with its NAT gateway, and the cluster,

349
00:20:15,009 --> 00:20:18,923
要等很久：按我们的估算，一刻钟或更久
the long wait: a quarter of an hour or more, by our estimate.

350
00:20:19,467 --> 00:20:21,017
然后是节点池
Then the node pool.

351
00:20:21,067 --> 00:20:25,907
一个用集群输出构建的 Kubernetes provider 会等这个节点池
A Kubernetes provider, built from the cluster outputs, waits for that pool,

352
00:20:25,907 --> 00:20:28,747
所以有节点之前不会创建任何 Pod
so no Pod is created before there are nodes.

353
00:20:28,984 --> 00:20:30,885
通过它创建的有
Through it come the namespace,

354
00:20:30,885 --> 00:20:35,193
namespace、API 的 Kubernetes 服务账号和它的绑定
the service account of the API and its binding, the two disk claims,

355
00:20:35,193 --> 00:20:37,538
两个磁盘 PVC、前端和向量数据库
the frontend and the vector database.

356
00:20:37,784 --> 00:20:40,856
接下来，加载器 Job 填充向量数据库
Next, the loader Job fills the vector database.

357
00:20:41,176 --> 00:20:46,523
Pulumi 要等 Job 完成后才创建 API
Pulumi creates the API only after the Job completes:

358
00:20:46,523 --> 00:20:50,328
第 319 到 321 行设定了这个依赖
lines 319 to 321 set that dependency.

359
00:20:50,567 --> 00:20:54,343
同时，Helm 安装 nginx Ingress controller
In parallel, Helm installs the nginx Ingress controller.

360
00:20:54,663 --> 00:20:57,077
它的 Service 申请一个负载均衡器
Its Service asks for a load balancer,

361
00:20:57,077 --> 00:21:00,210
于是控制器向云平台要一个地址
so the controllers ask the cloud for an address:

362
00:21:00,210 --> 00:21:02,364
第 1 部分的那个指示灯，这次是绿的
the part 1 lamp, green this time.

363
00:21:02,684 --> 00:21:06,204
这个地址变成一个主机名，Ingress 最后创建
That address becomes a host name, and the Ingress comes last.

364
00:21:07,184 --> 00:21:08,976
身份，分两部分
Identity, in two parts.

365
00:21:09,296 --> 00:21:14,269
Pulumi 和 kubectl 通过 GKE 认证插件连到 API server
Pulumi and kubectl reach the API server through the GKE auth plugin,

366
00:21:14,269 --> 00:21:18,512
也就是工具箱的修复 2，所以没有集群密码
fix two from the toolbox, so there is no cluster password.

367
00:21:19,250 --> 00:21:23,362
而 API 的 Pod 带着它的 Kubernetes 服务账号
And the API Pod wears its Kubernetes service account,

368
00:21:23,362 --> 00:21:28,871
Workload Identity 在 Vertex AI 门口把它换成 gcp-service
which Workload Identity swaps for gcp-service at the door to Vertex AI.

369
00:21:29,191 --> 00:21:31,474
集群里没有任何 JSON 密钥
No JSON key sits in the cluster.

370
00:21:32,217 --> 00:21:36,787
记住：Pulumi 只在这个工具箱里给 kubectl 连接一次
Keep in mind: Pulumi connects kubectl once, inside this toolbox,

371
00:21:36,787 --> 00:21:39,001
你退出时工具箱就被删掉了
which is removed when you exit.

372
00:21:39,321 --> 00:21:41,348
下次会话开始时没有连接
The next session starts unconnected.

373
00:21:41,668 --> 00:21:45,087
如果你的运行停下了，卡片列出四个常见原因
If yours stops, the card shows the four usual causes:

374
00:21:45,087 --> 00:21:46,830
暂停一下，对照你的报错
pause and match your error.

375
00:21:57,367 --> 00:22:00,908
第 20 讲在前面放了一个 nginx container
Lecture 20 put one nginx container in front.

376
00:22:01,228 --> 00:22:04,748
那个游戏开了自己的负载均衡器，一个应用一扇门
The game opened its own load balancer, one door per app.

377
00:22:05,068 --> 00:22:08,972
奶酪应用只开一扇门，门后有一位前台
The cheese app opens one door, with a receptionist behind it.

378
00:22:09,517 --> 00:22:11,732
README 画出了这条路径
The README draws the path:

379
00:22:11,732 --> 00:22:16,247
浏览器、负载均衡器、nginx Ingress controller
browser, load balancer, the nginx Ingress controller,

380
00:22:16,247 --> 00:22:20,081
然后是 3000 上的前端或 9000 上的 API
then the frontend on 3000 or the API on 9000,

381
00:22:20,081 --> 00:22:22,808
以及 8000 上的向量数据库
and the vector database on 8000.

382
00:22:23,050 --> 00:22:28,341
有一个小疏漏：README 把虚线箭头从向量数据库画到加载器
A small slip: the README draws the dotted arrow from the vector database to the loader.

383
00:22:28,661 --> 00:22:32,458
数据是反方向流的，从 Job 流进数据库
The data flows the other way, from the Job into the database.

384
00:22:32,700 --> 00:22:34,207
跟着一次点击走
Follow one click.

385
00:22:34,257 --> 00:22:40,060
你的 IP.sslip.io 会指回同一个 IP，什么都不用设置
<IP>.sslip.io points back to that same IP, with no setup at all.

386
00:22:40,380 --> 00:22:45,415
数据包经过云负载均衡器，落到 nginx controller 上
The packet passes the cloud load balancer and lands on the nginx controller.

387
00:22:46,050 --> 00:22:49,584
Ingress 规则从主机名开始
The Ingress rule starts with the host name:

388
00:22:49,584 --> 00:22:53,859
对这个主机，/api-service 去 9000 上的 API
for that host, /api-service goes to the API on 9000,

389
00:22:53,859 --> 00:22:57,229
其他路径都去 3000 上的前端
every other path to the frontend on 3000.

390
00:22:57,549 --> 00:23:00,124
这个 controller 按这条规则走
The controller follows that rule,

391
00:23:00,124 --> 00:23:03,949
就像第 20 讲的 nginx.conf，只是现在是自动生成的
like the nginx.conf of lecture 20, now generated.

392
00:23:04,484 --> 00:23:07,513
这次前缀保留了：没有东西去剪掉它
This time the prefix is kept: nothing strips it.

393
00:23:07,833 --> 00:23:13,372
API 把自己挂在它的根路径 /api-service 下面
The API mounts itself under its root path, /api-service,

394
00:23:13,372 --> 00:23:17,625
所以 /api-service/status 返回版本 3.0
so /api-service/status answers version 3.0.

395
00:23:18,567 --> 00:23:25,735
页面来自前端；然后你的浏览器直接调用 API，在 /api-service
The page comes from the frontend; then your browser calls the API directly, at /api-service.

396
00:23:26,534 --> 00:23:31,724
在集群内部，API 按 Service 名字找到 Chroma
Inside the cluster, the API reaches Chroma by its Service name,

397
00:23:31,724 --> 00:23:33,702
vector-db，port 8000
vector-db, on port 8000.

398
00:23:34,500 --> 00:23:39,599
现在打开裸 IP：同一个负载均衡器，不带 sslip.io
Now open the bare IP: the same load balancer, without sslip.io.

399
00:23:39,919 --> 00:23:41,519
谁来回答？
What answers?

400
00:23:50,084 --> 00:23:53,711
回答的是 nginx controller：404 Not Found
The nginx controller answers 404 Not Found.

401
00:23:54,031 --> 00:23:59,471
规则只匹配那个主机名，所以同一扇门、名字不对，就找不到路由
The rule matches only that host name, so the same door with the wrong name finds no route.

402
00:23:59,791 --> 00:24:02,009
用输出里的 app URL
Use the app_url from the outputs.

403
00:24:02,550 --> 00:24:08,135
这就勾上了负载均衡：门口是云负载均衡器，后面是 nginx
That ticks load balancing: the cloud load balancer at the door, nginx behind it,

404
00:24:08,135 --> 00:24:11,766
每个 Service 再把请求分散到它的 Pod 上
and each Service spreading requests across its Pods.

405
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:15,411
接下来，试几条 kubectl 命令
Next, try some kubectl commands.

406
00:24:15,731 --> 00:24:19,229
这里没有集群，五条都显示 connection refused
With no cluster here, all five say connection refused.

407
00:24:19,549 --> 00:24:23,001
在任何一个新的工具箱会话里你都会看到一模一样的结果
You will see exactly this in any new toolbox session:

408
00:24:23,001 --> 00:24:26,973
Pulumi 写的 kubeconfig 跟着旧 container 一起没了
the kubeconfig Pulumi wrote went away with the old container.

409
00:24:27,217 --> 00:24:29,699
修复办法就是 Pulumi 跑过的那条命令
The fix is the command Pulumi ran,

410
00:24:29,699 --> 00:24:32,619
在这里是额外步骤：gcloud container clusters
an extra here: gcloud container clusters

411
00:24:32,619 --> 00:24:35,174
get-credentials cheese-app-cluster
get-credentials cheese-app-cluster.

412
00:24:35,494 --> 00:24:40,785
代码把区域传给了 --zone 参数；写成 --region，才名副其实
The code passes the region to the --zone flag; write --region, which says what it means.

413
00:24:41,533 --> 00:24:45,539
连上以后，get all 还是只显示 kubernetes 这个 Service
Once connected, get all still shows only the kubernetes Service,

414
00:24:45,539 --> 00:24:48,168
因为应用在它自己的 namespace 里
because the app sits in its own namespace.

415
00:24:48,488 --> 00:24:50,780
加上 -n cheese-app-namespace
With -n cheese-app-namespace,

416
00:24:50,780 --> 00:24:55,997
你的会列出前端、数据库、API 和 nginx controller 的 Pod
yours lists the frontend, database, API and nginx controller Pods,

417
00:24:55,997 --> 00:24:58,685
还有一个标着 Completed 的加载器 Pod
and a loader Pod marked Completed.

418
00:24:59,005 --> 00:25:01,233
命令 get nodes 显示一个节点，或者两个
Get nodes shows one node, or two.

419
00:25:01,767 --> 00:25:04,261
README 的下一步是进到一个 Pod 的 shell 里
The next README step shells into a Pod.

420
00:25:04,455 --> 00:25:07,311
README 里的 Pod 名字是作者自己的
The Pod name in the README is the author's own;

421
00:25:07,311 --> 00:25:09,681
用你第一条命令打印出来的名字
use the name your first command prints.

422
00:25:10,317 --> 00:25:13,397
进去以后，你拿到的是 API container 里的一个 shell
Inside, you get a shell in the API container,

423
00:25:13,397 --> 00:25:15,245
和我们在游戏里做的一样
just as we did in the game.

424
00:25:15,565 --> 00:25:18,104
打印它的环境变量，找 ROOT PATH 这个变量
Print its environment and look for ROOT_PATH.

425
00:25:18,424 --> 00:25:20,024
暂停一下，试一试
Pause and try it.

426
00:25:20,517 --> 00:25:25,360
为了查看应用，README 给了一段输出，比代码稍旧一点
To view the app, the README shows an outputs block a little older than the code.

427
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:30,099
现在地址叫 ip address，不叫 nginx ingress ip
Today the address is called ip_address, not nginx_ingress_ip,

428
00:25:30,099 --> 00:25:33,359
Ingress 叫 cheese-app-ingress
and the Ingress is called cheese-app-ingress.

429
00:25:34,100 --> 00:25:36,105
暂停一下，打开你的 app URL
Pause and open your app_url.

430
00:25:36,425 --> 00:25:42,332
页脚显示 API version: 3.0，就证明整条路径都通了
A footer that says API version: 3.0 proves the whole path works:

431
00:25:42,332 --> 00:25:44,916
它请求的是 /api-service/status
it asks /api-service/status.

432
00:25:45,236 --> 00:25:47,803
然后在聊天里选 RAG 模型
Then pick the RAG model in the chat;

433
00:25:47,803 --> 00:25:50,655
有回复，就证明 Vertex AI 和 Chroma 也通了
a reply proves Vertex AI and Chroma too.

434
00:25:50,900 --> 00:25:57,428
刚部署完你可能会看到 502 或 503：API 还在加载 TensorFlow
Right after deploying you may see 502 or 503: the API is still loading TensorFlow.

435
00:25:57,748 --> 00:25:59,348
等一等，再试一次
Wait, and try again.

436
00:26:00,483 --> 00:26:04,408
README 的调试那一块有 14 条 kubectl 命令
The README's debugging block has 14 kubectl commands.

437
00:26:04,728 --> 00:26:07,767
照原样敲，全都会失败；大多数都说找不到
As typed, they all fail; most say the namespace,

438
00:26:07,767 --> 00:26:10,488
cheese-app-cluster-namespace 这个 namespace
cheese-app-cluster-namespace, is not found.

439
00:26:10,733 --> 00:26:14,257
带尖括号的 pod name 那几行是 shell 重定向
Lines with <pod-name> are shell redirections:

440
00:26:14,257 --> 00:26:18,093
把整个占位符连同尖括号一起替换掉
replace the whole placeholder, brackets included.

441
00:26:18,833 --> 00:26:22,273
两处修复：namespace 是 cheese-app-namespace
Two fixes: the namespace is cheese-app-namespace,

442
00:26:22,273 --> 00:26:24,379
而 Job 只有一个 container
and the Job has one container,

443
00:26:24,379 --> 00:26:27,046
所以去掉 -c wait-for-chromadb 这个参数
so drop the -c wait-for-chromadb flag.

444
00:26:27,366 --> 00:26:28,966
暂停一下，试一试
Pause and try them.

445
00:26:29,366 --> 00:26:32,507
在一个确实存在的 Job 上，在替身上做个额外检查
On a Job that exists, an extra on the stand-in,

446
00:26:32,507 --> 00:26:35,446
同样的命令都能用：done，1 个 Succeeded
the same commands work: done, one succeeded.

447
00:26:35,766 --> 00:26:38,156
已经完成的 Job，它的 Pod 不会被替换
Nothing replaces a finished Job's Pod.

448
00:26:38,900 --> 00:26:43,016
说明一点：磁盘挂载在 /chroma/chroma
A small note: the disk is mounted at /chroma/chroma,

449
00:26:43,016 --> 00:26:46,260
但如今的 Chroma 镜像写到 /data
but today's Chroma image writes to /data.

450
00:26:46,580 --> 00:26:51,039
所以向量存在 container 里面，Pod 一重启就没了
So the vectors live inside the container and vanish when the Pod restarts.

451
00:26:51,359 --> 00:26:57,502
把第 150 行改成 /data，或者重启以后再跑一次加载器 Job
Change line 150 to /data, or run the loader Job again after a restart.

452
00:27:00,650 --> 00:27:01,987
现在讲扩展
Now scaling.

453
00:27:02,037 --> 00:27:06,887
课上承诺按 CPU、内存或自定义指标扩展
The lecture promises scaling on CPU, memory or custom metrics,

454
00:27:06,887 --> 00:27:10,954
但代码没有设副本数，也没有 Pod 自动扩缩器
but the code sets no replicas and no Pod autoscaler.

455
00:27:11,274 --> 00:27:14,154
它打开的是节点这一层：一到两个节点
It switches on the node layer: one to two nodes.

456
00:27:14,900 --> 00:27:18,228
调度器按 requests 把 Pod 装到节点上
The scheduler packs Pods onto nodes by their requests.

457
00:27:18,548 --> 00:27:22,196
前端申请四分之一个 CPU 和 2 GB
The frontend asks for a quarter CPU and 2 gigabytes.

458
00:27:22,516 --> 00:27:24,795
Chroma 和 nginx 申请得很少
Chroma and nginx ask for little,

459
00:27:24,795 --> 00:27:28,425
API 什么都没申请，所以谁也没法为它做规划
and the API for nothing, so nobody can plan for it.

460
00:27:29,066 --> 00:27:33,503
把前端扩到 3 个；Milestone 5 要求你展示扩展
Scale the frontend to 3; Milestone 5 asks you to show scaling.

461
00:27:33,823 --> 00:27:36,490
放不下的副本会等着，处于 Pending
A copy that does not fit waits, pending,

462
00:27:36,490 --> 00:27:39,157
直到自动扩缩器加上第二个节点
until the autoscaler adds a second node.

463
00:27:39,477 --> 00:27:43,274
要得再多一些，有些就会一直 Pending：节点池到两个就停了
Ask for many more, and some stay pending: the pool stops at two.

464
00:27:43,916 --> 00:27:47,287
API 的磁盘一次只能挂到一个节点上
The API's disk attaches to one node at a time.

465
00:27:47,607 --> 00:27:52,705
假设你把 API 扩到 3 个，有些副本落在了第二个节点上
Suppose you scaled the API to 3, and some copies landed on the second node.

466
00:27:53,025 --> 00:27:56,162
它们会怎样，自动扩缩器能解决吗？
What happens to them, and can the autoscaler fix it?

467
00:28:07,300 --> 00:28:10,760
它们一直卡在创建中，报 Multi-Attach 错误
They stay stuck creating, with a Multi-Attach error:

468
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:12,889
磁盘已经挂在节点 1 上了
the disk already sits on node 1.

469
00:28:13,209 --> 00:28:16,110
加节点没用；限制在磁盘
More nodes do not help; the limit is the disk.

470
00:28:16,350 --> 00:28:21,974
这就勾上了扩展，分两层：节点自动扩缩，Pod 由你手动扩
That ticks scaling, in two levels: nodes automatically, Pods in your hands;

471
00:28:21,974 --> 00:28:26,547
按 CPU 的 Pod 自动扩缩器需要 requests，而 API 没有
a Pod autoscaler on CPU needs requests, and the API has none.

472
00:28:26,867 --> 00:28:28,744
缩回 1 个，等你用完以后
Scale back to 1 when you are done.

473
00:28:29,983 --> 00:28:34,911
最后，删除集群：pulumi destroy --stack dev --refresh -y
Last, delete the cluster: pulumi destroy --stack dev --refresh -y.

474
00:28:35,231 --> 00:28:37,296
我们的没有真东西可删
Ours has nothing real to delete;

475
00:28:37,296 --> 00:28:40,908
你的会删掉这个 stack 创建的东西，倒着来
yours deletes what this stack created, in reverse order,

476
00:28:40,908 --> 00:28:43,295
从 Ingress 一直删到网络
from the Ingress down to the network.

477
00:28:43,916 --> 00:28:46,769
然后检查可能残留的东西，这是我们的建议
Then check what may survive, our suggestion:

478
00:28:46,769 --> 00:28:50,529
列出集群、转发规则、磁盘和防火墙规则
list clusters, forwarding rules, disks and firewall rules.

479
00:28:50,849 --> 00:28:56,567
这些是在后台删除的，可能会被落下；找名字里带 pvc 的磁盘
Those are deleted in the background and can be left behind; look for disks named pvc.

480
00:28:56,816 --> 00:29:00,720
registry 里的 image 是故意留下的：在控制台里删掉
Registry images stay on purpose: delete them in the console.

481
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:04,304
第 20 讲那台机器也删掉，如果它还在运行
Delete the lecture 20 machine too, if it still runs.

482
00:29:04,624 --> 00:29:05,966
暂停一下，检查一遍
Pause and check.

483
00:29:06,016 --> 00:29:07,616
回到三个诉求
Back to the three asks.

484
00:29:07,787 --> 00:29:10,770
故障转移：ReplicaSet 把 Pod 带回来
Failover: the ReplicaSet brings Pods back,

485
00:29:10,770 --> 00:29:14,037
节点自动修复替换坏掉的机器
and node auto repair replaces broken machines.

486
00:29:14,357 --> 00:29:19,157
负载均衡：云负载均衡器、nginx 和 Service
Load balancing: the cloud load balancer, nginx and the Services.

487
00:29:19,477 --> 00:29:23,659
扩展：节点自动扩缩器，还有你手里的 kubectl scale
Scaling: the node autoscaler, and kubectl scale in your hands.

488
00:29:23,900 --> 00:29:25,799
课上列了五个好处
The lecture lists five payoffs.

489
00:29:26,119 --> 00:29:28,209
自助服务：一次 pulumi up
Self-service: one pulumi up.

490
00:29:28,529 --> 00:29:31,260
成本更低：Pod 按 requests 紧凑地装
Lower cost: Pods packed by their requests.

491
00:29:31,580 --> 00:29:34,481
自动调整：节点自动扩缩器
Automatic adjustment: the node autoscaler.

492
00:29:34,801 --> 00:29:36,785
运行平稳：自愈
Smooth running: self-healing.

493
00:29:37,105 --> 00:29:40,860
开发更简单：和第 20 讲一样的 image
Simpler development: the same images as lecture 20.

494
00:29:41,100 --> 00:29:42,479
自测一下
Test yourself.

495
00:29:42,529 --> 00:29:48,460
控制平面里哪个组件决定新 Pod 跑在哪里，哪个发现 Pod 死了？
Which control plane part decides where a new Pod runs, and which one notices that a Pod died?

496
00:29:48,780 --> 00:29:51,849
为什么 get all 只显示 kubernetes 这个 Service
Why does get all show only the kubernetes Service,

497
00:29:51,849 --> 00:29:53,449
用哪个参数能解决？
and what flag fixes it?

498
00:29:53,500 --> 00:29:56,132
名叫 web 的 Service 怎么知道它的 Pod
How does the web Service know its Pods,

499
00:29:56,132 --> 00:29:59,303
API 为什么在 vector-db 找到 Chroma？
and why does the API reach Chroma at vector-db?

500
00:29:59,623 --> 00:30:03,762
从 sslip.io 一路追踪一次点击到 API 的 Pod
Trace one click from sslip.io to the API Pod;

501
00:30:03,762 --> 00:30:06,705
为什么裸 IP 返回 404？
why does the bare IP answer 404?

502
00:30:06,950 --> 00:30:10,474
为什么前端能扩到 3 个，而 API 不行
Why can the frontend scale to 3 but the API cannot,

503
00:30:10,474 --> 00:30:12,753
自动扩缩器加的又是什么？
and what does the autoscaler add?

504
00:30:13,073 --> 00:30:16,251
答案在练习和学习指南里
Answers are in the exercises and the study guide.

505
00:30:16,500 --> 00:30:19,812
下一讲，也就是第 23 讲，这两个 Pulumi 程序
Next, in lecture 23, the two Pulumi programs,

506
00:30:19,812 --> 00:30:24,521
在 app 的版本 4 里，会在每次合并时由 GitHub Actions 运行
in version 4 of the app, run from GitHub Actions on every merge.
